# deploy/ is copied onto Linux machines — a VPS, an appliance — and read by
# wg-quick, HAProxy, systemd and Caddy there. Checked out with CRLF (this
# repo is worked on from Windows with core.autocrlf on), those files carry a
# carriage return into every value. Pinned to LF here only; the rest of the
# repo keeps whatever each contributor's Git does.
deploy/** text eol=lf
